Maintainer: Hector Marina <hector.marina@slu.se>
Description: Provides tools to simulate stochastic disease transmission in 
  populations connected through temporal contact networks and to evaluate 
  likely transmission networks and individual transmission pathways. 
  The package supports multiple contact-network structures, 
  stochastic epidemic models, transmission-parameter estimation, and 
  inference of potential sources of infection.
